{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["חֶסֶד הוּא — like: ״פֶּן יַחְסְדְךָ שֹׁמֵעַ״. And likewise: ״וָחֶסֶד לְאֻמִּים חַטָּאת״ — disgrace of nations by means of sin. And likewise Targum Yosef: וְחִיסוּד דְּעַמָּא חַטָּוָהִי."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {0 "The biblical prooftexts cited (Proverbs 25:10 and Proverbs 14:34) carry no addresses in the source; addresses not added. The phrase קלון לאומים ע\"י חטאת appears to be Rashbam's gloss on the Proverbs 14:34 quotation rather than a separate citation; rendered literally."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:11.430197075Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}